---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import '../../styles/servicios.css';
---

<Layout title="Publicidad digital en Meta y Google Ads | Kaptativa" description="Campañas en Meta Ads y Google Ads con medición precisa (API de Conversiones) y foco en el retorno real de tu inversión publicitaria.">
  <Header slot="header" floating />
  
  <main class="servicio-page">
    <!-- HERO INMERSIVO -->
    <section class="hero hero-section" id="inicio">
      <div class="hero-glow-1"></div>
      <div class="hero-glow-2"></div>
      
      <div class="container hero-container">
        <div class="hero-content reveal">
          <h1 class="hero-tagline">Anuncios con retorno real: dejá de <span class="text-gradient-cyan">quemar tu presupuesto</span></h1>
          <p class="hero-description">No te vendemos clics vacíos ni likes estéticos. Diseñamos y gestionamos paid media en Meta (Instagram/Facebook) y Google Ads con foco exclusivo en retorno de inversión (ROI) medible. Nunca corremos una campaña sin tracking instalado.</p>
          
          <div class="hero-buttons">
            <a href="/contacto/" class="btn btn-primary btn-glow">Solicitar demo</a>
            <a href="https://wa.me/5493804890834?text=Hola!%20Quiero%20auditar%20mis%20campa%C3%B1as%20y%20mejorar%20mi%20ROI%20en%20publicidad." target="_blank" class="btn btn-secondary btn-whatsapp">
              Escribinos por WhatsApp
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- RESULTADOS (MÉTRICAS) -->
    <section class="section-metrics reveal">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="metrics-grid-premium">
          <div class="metric-card-glass">
            <span class="metric-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 7h6v6"/><path d="m22 7-8.5 8.5-5-5L2 17"/></svg></span>
            <div class="metric-value">ROI</div>
            <div class="metric-label">Optimizamos por retorno, no por clics</div>
          </div>
          <div class="metric-card-glass">
            <span class="metric-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"/></svg></span>
            <div class="metric-value">100%</div>
            <div class="metric-label">Tracking de conversiones C-API</div>
          </div>
          <div class="metric-card-glass">
            <span class="metric-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/></svg></span>
            <div class="metric-value">72hs</div>
            <div class="metric-label">Optimización inicial de pauta</div>
          </div>
          <div class="metric-card-glass">
            <span class="metric-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m3 11 18-5v12L3 14v-3z"/><path d="M11.6 16.8a3 3 0 1 1-5.8-1.6"/></svg></span>
            <div class="metric-value long">Meta y Google</div>
            <div class="metric-label">Campañas en las dos plataformas</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- LO QUE IMPORTA (EL DOLOR VS LA SOLUCIÓN) -->
    <section class="section" id="lo-que-importa">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header reveal">
          <h2>Por qué la mayoría de las campañas solo queman presupuesto</h2>
          <p>El marketing digital no se trata de apretar el botón de "Promocionar". Se trata de tracking confiable, embudos persuasivos y matemática pura.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="comparison-grid">
          <!-- El problema -->
          <div class="comp-card-bad reveal">
            <div class="comp-card-header">
              <div class="comp-icon-box bad-box"><svg class="glyph" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg></div>
              <h3>Agencias tradicionales</h3>
            </div>
            <ul class="comp-list">
              <li><span><svg class="glyph" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg></span> Cobran porcentaje de pauta (mientras más gastás, más les pagás).</li>
              <li><span><svg class="glyph" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg></span> Reportan clics e impresiones vacías sin valor comercial real.</li>
              <li><span><svg class="glyph" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg></span> No implementan tracking avanzado, perdiendo hasta 40% de conversiones.</li>
              <li><span><svg class="glyph" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg></span> Diseños repetitivos que no detienen el scroll del usuario en celular.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <!-- La solución -->
          <div class="comp-card-good reveal">
            <div class="comp-card-header">
              <div class="comp-icon-box good-box"><svg class="glyph" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></div>
              <h3>Paid media científico</h3>
            </div>
            <ul class="comp-list">
              <li><span><svg class="glyph" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span> Fee fijo mensual: alineados a cuidar y maximizar tu inversión.</li>
              <li><span><svg class="glyph" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span> Reportes de leads calificados, ventas reales y costo de adquisición.</li>
              <li><span><svg class="glyph" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span> API de conversiones del lado del servidor (C-API) para datos 100% exactos.</li>
              <li><span><svg class="glyph" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span> Anuncios y videos validados psicológicamente para llamar la atención.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- LO QUE INCLUYE (PILARES) -->
    <section class="section section-dark" id="lo-que-incluye">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header reveal">
          <h2>Todo lo que hace falta para que la inversión rinda</h2>
          <p>Un sistema de pauta de alta precisión que abarca todas las aristas de tus campañas.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="pillars-grid">
          <!-- Pilar 1 -->
          <div class="glass-card-premium reveal" style="--card-accent: var(--accent-indigo); --card-accent-glow: var(--accent-indigo-glow); justify-content: space-between; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
            <div>
              <div class="pillar-icon">
                <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 3v18h18"></path><path d="M18.7 8l-5.1 5.2-2.8-2.7L7 14.3"></path></svg>
              </div>
              <h3>Estrategia de embudo completo</h3>
              <p>Diseñamos el recorrido completo del cliente (Atracción, Consideración y Conversión) para Meta y Google, con presupuesto asignado por etapa y objetivo claro. No tirás plata a un solo público y esperás.</p>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Embedded Mock Dashboard -->
            <div class="mock-db-widget" style="margin-top: 20px; background: rgba(15, 15, 18, 0.4); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px; font-family: 'Lexend', sans-serif; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; box-shadow: inset 0 0 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);">
              <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); padding-bottom: 8px;">
                <span style="font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent-indigo); ">Meta y Google Ads</span>
                <span style="font-size: 0.7rem; color: #10b981; background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600;">● Active</span>
              </div>
              <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;">
                <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--text-muted);">
                  <span>Fase 1: Atracción</span>
                  <span>$120.00 spend</span>
                </div>
                <div style="height: 4px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 2px; overflow: hidden;">
                  <div style="height: 100%; width: 25%; background: var(--accent-pink);"></div>
                </div>
                <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--text-muted);">
                  <span>Fase 2: Interés</span>
                  <span>$240.00 spend</span>
                </div>
                <div style="height: 4px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 2px; overflow: hidden;">
                  <div style="height: 100%; width: 50%; background: var(--accent-indigo);"></div>
                </div>
                <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--text-muted);">
                  <span>Fase 3: Cierre</span>
                  <span>$480.00 spend</span>
                </div>
                <div style="height: 4px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 2px; overflow: hidden;">
                  <div style="height: 100%; width: 100%; background: var(--accent-crimson);"></div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Pilar 2 -->
          <div class="glass-card-premium reveal" style="--card-accent: var(--accent-pink); --card-accent-glow: var(--accent-pink-glow); justify-content: space-between; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
            <div>
              <div class="pillar-icon">
                <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"></polygon></svg>
              </div>
              <h3>Testing de ángulos</h3>
              <p>Diseñamos los anuncios y probamos múltiples mensajes y creatividades hasta encontrar la combinación ganadora para tu negocio.</p>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Mini Creative Testing comparison -->
            <div class="mock-testing-widget" style="margin-top: 20px; display: flex; gap: 8px; font-family: 'Lexend', sans-serif;">
              <div style="flex: 1; background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.10); border-radius: 8px; padding: 6px; text-align: center; position: relative;">
                <span style="font-size: 0.55rem; background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.1); color: var(--accent-crimson); padding: 1px 4px; border-radius: 8px; position: absolute; top: -7px; left: 6px; font-weight: 600;">Ángulo A</span>
                <div style="font-size: 0.65rem; color: var(--text-muted); text-decoration: line-through; margin-top: 2px;">CPA: $4.20</div>
                <div style="font-size: 0.55rem; color: #ef4444; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 2px;">Apagado <svg class="glyph" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg></div>
              </div>
              <div style="flex: 1; background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15); border-radius: 8px; padding: 6px; text-align: center; position: relative;">
                <span style="font-size: 0.55rem; background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1); color: #10b981; padding: 1px 4px; border-radius: 8px; position: absolute; top: -7px; left: 6px; font-weight: 600;">Ángulo B</span>
                <div style="font-size: 0.65rem; color: #ffffff; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 2px;">CPA: $1.90</div>
                <div style="font-size: 0.55rem; color: #10b981; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 2px;">Ganador <svg class="glyph" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Pilar 3 -->
          <div class="glass-card-premium reveal" style="--card-accent: var(--accent-crimson); --card-accent-glow: var(--accent-crimson-glow); justify-content: space-between; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
            <div>
              <div class="pillar-icon">
                <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="18" y1="20" x2="18" y2="10"></line><line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12" y2="4"></line><line x1="6" y1="20" x2="6" y2="14"></line></svg>
              </div>
              <h3>Dashboards en tiempo real</h3>
              <p>Ves cómo rinde tu inversión cuando querés, sin esperar al cierre de mes.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- Mini Live Sparkline -->
            <div class="mock-dash-widget" style="margin-top: 20px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.02); border-radius: 8px; padding: 8px 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; font-family: 'Lexend', sans-serif;">
              <span style="font-size: 0.65rem; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 600;">Live ROI Tracker</span>
              <svg width="60" height="20" viewBox="0 0 60 20" fill="none">
                <path d="M0 15 L10 12 L20 16 L30 8 L40 10 L50 2 L60 4" stroke="var(--accent-crimson)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                <path d="M0 15 L10 12 L20 16 L30 8 L40 10 L50 2 L60 4 L60 20 L0 20 Z" fill="url(#cyan-glow-grad-pauta)" opacity="0.1" />
                <defs>
                  <linearGradient id="cyan-glow-grad-pauta" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
                    <stop offset="0%" stop-color="var(--accent-crimson)" />
                    <stop offset="100%" stop-color="transparent" />
                  </linearGradient>
                </defs>
              </svg>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Pilar 4 -->
          <div class="glass-card-premium reveal" style="--card-accent: #6A48F5; --card-accent-glow: rgba(106, 72, 245, 0.15); justify-content: space-between; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
            <div>
              <div class="pillar-icon">
                <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"></circle></svg>
              </div>
              <h3>Tracking desde el día uno</h3>
              <p>Medición a prueba de bloqueadores. Configuramos píxel, servidor (C-API) y eventos del embudo para no perder datos de conversión.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- Mini C-API Match Status -->
            <div class="mock-tracking-widget" style="margin-top: 20px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.02); border-radius: 8px; padding: 8px 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; font-family: 'Lexend', sans-serif;">
              <span style="font-size: 0.65rem; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 600;">Server C-API Status</span>
              <span style="font-size: 0.6rem; color: #10b981; background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px;">
                <span style="width: 5px; height: 5px; background: #10b981; border-radius: 50%;"></span>
                100% Match
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    
    <!-- APLICACIONES POR RUBRO / SECTOR -->
    <section class="section section-rubros" id="rubros">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header reveal" style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 50px;">
          <h2>Soluciones adaptadas a tu modelo de negocio</h2>
          <p style="max-width: 750px; margin: 0 auto; color: var(--text-secondary);">Diseñamos y programamos según la lógica comercial de tu sector para asegurar el máximo retorno.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="rubros-grid reveal">
          <!-- Tarjeta 1 -->
          <div class="rubro-card">
            <div class="card-header-row">
              <div class="card-header-left">
                <div class="rubro-icon-wrapper wrapper-emerald">
                  <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"></path><polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"></polyline></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Inmobiliarias y corredores</h3>
              </div>
              <svg class="card-chevron" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
            </div>
            <p>Campañas geolocalizadas enfocadas a loteos, proyectos en pozo o alquileres, captando leads altamente interesados y derivándolos a tu WhatsApp.</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Tarjeta 2 -->
          <div class="rubro-card">
            <div class="card-header-row">
              <div class="card-header-left">
                <div class="rubro-icon-wrapper wrapper-purple">
                  <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="7" width="20" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M16 21V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16"></path></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Servicios B2B y consultoras</h3>
              </div>
              <svg class="card-chevron" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
            </div>
            <p>Anuncios en LinkedIn, Meta y Google dirigidos a directores y gerentes de empresas ofreciendo auditorías de procesos o casos de estudio de éxito.</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Tarjeta 3 -->
          <div class="rubro-card">
            <div class="card-header-row">
              <div class="card-header-left">
                <div class="rubro-icon-wrapper wrapper-orange">
                  <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 2L3 6v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6l-3-4z"></path><line x1="3" y1="6" x2="21" y2="6"></line><path d="M16 10a4 4 0 0 1-8 0"></path></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>E-commerce y tiendas</h3>
              </div>
              <svg class="card-chevron" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
            </div>
            <p>Campañas de catálogo dinámico y retargeting avanzado para usuarios que vieron productos o abandonaron el carrito de compras, impulsando la recompra.</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Tarjeta 4 -->
          <div class="rubro-card">
            <div class="card-header-row">
              <div class="card-header-left">
                <div class="rubro-icon-wrapper wrapper-crimson">
                  <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Negocios locales y profesionales</h3>
              </div>
              <svg class="card-chevron" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
            </div>
            <p>Publicidad local dirigida por zonas geográficas para captar clientes en locales físicos o agendar turnos directos en consultorios y agencias.</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Tarjeta 5 -->
          <div class="rubro-card">
            <div class="card-header-row">
              <div class="card-header-left">
                <div class="rubro-icon-wrapper wrapper-pink">
                  <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2"></path></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Salud y clínicas estéticas</h3>
              </div>
              <svg class="card-chevron" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
            </div>
            <p>Campañas locales hiper-segmentadas enfocadas en la captación de pacientes para tratamientos, odontología o medicina estética, con agendamiento directo en WhatsApp.</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Tarjeta 6 -->
          <div class="rubro-card">
            <div class="card-header-row">
              <div class="card-header-left">
                <div class="rubro-icon-wrapper wrapper-blue">
